      "content": "I see. So you're saying the risk is tied to these inherent regional patterns of tribalism and historical friction? If we were looking at a similar ethnic split in Eastern Europe or even parts of Southeast Asia, would your risk assessment be as high, or do these specific demographic distributions in Africa carry a more predictable pattern of instability?",
